{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21113","headline":"松鹤 · 元稹","name":"松鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渚宫本坳下，佛庙有台阁。\n台下三四松，低昂势前却。\n是时晴景丽，松梢残雪薄。\n日色相玲珑，纤云暎罗幕。\n逡巡九霄外，似振风中铎。\n渐见尺帛光，孤飞唳空鹤。\n裴回耀霜雪，顾慕下寥廓。\n蹋动樛盘枝，龙蛇互跳跃。\n俯瞰九江水，旁瞻万里壑。\n无心眄乌鸢，有字悲城郭。\n清角已沈绝，虞韶亦冥寞。\n骞翻勿重留，幸及钧天作。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}